        <mxCell id="332" value="Why device_code flow?&#10;  authorization_code flow requires a local callback port on the developer's machine.&#10;  This fails in remote dev environments (SSH sessions, containers, VMs).&#10;  device_code: developer just opens a URL in any browser — no local port needed." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=12;">
