        <mxCell id="382" value="LibreChat uses CONVERSE_OPENAI_API_KEY (a Lightbridge API key).&#10;ALL LibreChat users share this one key — billing is against the LibreChat account, not individual users.&#10;Individual user quotas within LibreChat are enforced by LibreChat's own config (librechat.yaml),&#10;not by the Envoy gateway." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=12;">
